         // use it: their PNG writes stall the frames, and the controller would then lower the scale to its floor.
+        // SCRATCH (t0-3vwx, never commit to src): with TERTIUS_X_HISTORY_LOG=<folder>, each draw first reads the slow diffuse
+        // history that the draws before it left (ScreenTraceSignals.Diffuse.Slow(0): a = the length in draws) over the render
